# The #5267 defect: a driver that joined a remediation drives a later one
# and records its outcome.
MODULE: OutcomeOfFollowedDrivesAnother
TARGET: OutcomeOfFollowed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a driver slices and reports whatever remediation is in flight (#5267)
PERTURBS: Slice, Observe
BOUNDS: OpCount = 3, MaxStalls = 0

--- FIND
    /\ remOwner = opFollows[o]
    /\ (~Stop(o) \/ ~CancelAccepted(o))
--- REPLACE
    /\ (~Stop(o) \/ ~CancelAccepted(o))
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ (~remInProgress \/ remOwner # opFollows[o])
    /\ Report(o, IF ~remInProgress /\ remLast = opFollows[o] THEN remLast ELSE NoOp)
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~remInProgress
    /\ Report(o, remLast)
--- END
